### WhatsApp Connection API - Test Requests

### 1. Check WhatsApp Status
GET http://localhost:3000/whatsapp/status
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get QR Code for WhatsApp Authentication
GET http://localhost:3000/whatsapp/qrcode
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Disconnect WhatsApp
POST http://localhost:3000/whatsapp/disconnect
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Restart WhatsApp Connection
POST http://localhost:3000/whatsapp/restart
Content-Type: application/json

###
